(1, 'PCAT-DF6Q-SYO7', NULL, 'Boom Lifts', 'boom-lift-rentals', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Boom Lift Rentals: Safe, Reliable, and Cost-Effective <br>Solutions for Elevated Work</h1>\r\n<p>Are you searching for a reliable way to safely work at heights? Our boom lift rentals provide the perfect solution, offering safe, efficient access for various elevated tasks across industries such as construction, maintenance, and tree care. Renting a boom lift not only saves you money but also ensures you have the latest, well-maintained equipment ready when you need it.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Why Rent Boom Lifts from Us?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Wide Range of Models:</strong> We offer a variety of boom lifts, including articulated, telescopic, and trailer-mounted options, designed to meet your specific project needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Safety and Compliance:</strong> Our boom lifts are equipped with advanced safety features, such as stabilization systems and emergency controls, ensuring compliance with industry safety standards.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Expert Support:</strong> Our team is here to help you choose the right boom lift for your project, providing expert guidance to ensure safe and efficient operations.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Flexible Rental Terms:</strong> With rental options ranging from daily to long-term contracts, we cater to all project sizes and budgets, providing you with the flexibility to scale as needed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Key Features of Our Boom Lift</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Impressive Working Heights and Outreach:</strong> Our boom lifts offer working heights of up to 56 feet and impressive outreach capabilities, making them ideal for reaching difficult areas safely.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Compact and Maneuverable:</strong> Designed to navigate tight spaces, our compact boom lifts are easy to transport and operate on various job sites.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Eco-Friendly Options:</strong> We offer boom lift models that provide low emissions and fuel efficiency, making them perfect for both indoor (with adequate ventilation) and outdoor projects.</li>\r\n<li><strong>User-Friendly Controls:</strong> Our boom lifts are equipped with intuitive controls, allowing operators of all experience levels to work efficiently and confidently.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Applications of Boom Lifts</h2>\r\n<p>Our boom lifts are versatile and can be used for a variety of tasks</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Construction:</strong> Ideal for tasks like roofing, siding, steel erection, and general construction work.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Maintenance:</strong> Perfect for building maintenance, window cleaning, painting, and other upkeep tasks.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Tree Care:</strong> Safe and effective for trimming, pruning, and tree removal without the need for ladders.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Choosing the Right Boom Lift for Your Project</h2>\r\n<p>Selecting the correct boom lift depends on your project’s height, reach, and terrain requirements. Consider factors such as the working height, outreach, and ground conditions. Our knowledgeable team can help you identify the best lift for your specific needs, ensuring maximum productivity and safety.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Safety and Training Commitment</h2>\r\n<p>At Rent \'n King, safety is our top priority. We offer optional operator training and guides to ensure your team is comfortable and confident using our boom lifts. Additionally, we rigorously inspect all equipment before each rental, ensuring it meets the highest safety standards.</p>\r\n<p>Safety harnesses are always available for rent or to buy so you own your own boom lift harness kit.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Advantages of Renting vs. Buying</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Cost Savings:</strong> Avoid the significant upfront costs of purchasing and the ongoing maintenance expenses.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Access to the Latest Equipment:</strong> Renting allows you to use the latest models with advanced safety and efficiency features.</li>\r\n<li><strong>No Storage or Transport Worries:</strong> Renting removes the need for storage space and complex logistics, giving you more freedom to focus on your work.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Service Areas</h2>\r\n<p>Proudly serving the following areas in Tennessee: Dickson, Fairview, Centerville, Franklin, Bon Aqua, Charlotte, Van Leer, McEwen, Waverly, Burns, Clarksville, Santa Fe, Nashville, Primm Springs, Kingston Springs, Cumberland Furnace, Cunningham and more. Our team is committed to delivering top-notch service, and we offer delivery to out-of-area locations, ensuring you get the equipment you need no matter where your project takes you.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>We also deliver to out-of-area locations and go where others refuse to deliver.</p>\r\n<p>Contact Us Today for Boom Lift Rental - <a href=\"tel:615208156734\"><strong>(615) 815-6734</strong></a></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Ready to elevate your project? Contact us today to learn more about our boom lift rentals and find the perfect lift for your needs. Our team is here to assist you with expert advice and flexible rental options.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><iframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gKdAVVo9NvY?si=g57-VsreHP3dFbAx\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>', 'Boom Lift Rentals – Nashville TN | Rent \'n King', 'Rent boom lifts (aerial lifts) with fast delivery in Nashville, Dickson, Waverly, Fairview and Clarksville. Weekend Special Fri–Mon. Free reschedules 24+ hrs.', 17, 18, 'Published', 'No', 7, 1, 4, '2025-09-01 03:37:55', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(3, 'PCAT-VUNN-QVVI', NULL, 'Bulldozers', 'bulldozer-rental', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">New 2024 & 2025 Cat D3 Bulldozer Rentals</h1>\r\n<p>When your project demands precision, power, and comfort, the <strong>2024 & 2025 Cat D3 Bulldozer</strong> is the machine that delivers. Available now for rental at Rent ’n King, this dozer is built to handle everything from fine grading to heavy pushing, all while keeping operators productive and comfortable in every season.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Unmatched Power and Capacity</h2>\r\n<p>The Cat D3 is engineered with a powerful engine and an efficient hydrostatic transmission that ensures smooth operation and consistent pushing power. With an operating weight of approximately <strong>20,000 pounds</strong>, this bulldozer strikes the perfect balance between maneuverability and raw strength. Whether you’re leveling building pads, clearing land, or working on road construction, the D3 offers the capacity you need to move material quickly and efficiently.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Exceptional Performance and Stability</h2>\r\n<p>Performance is where the 2024 & 2025 Cat D3 truly shines. Its advanced undercarriage system provides excellent traction, even in difficult terrain, while maintaining fuel efficiency and low ground disturbance. The integrated grade and slope control make fine grading tasks easier, saving both time and money on site prep. With responsive controls and reliable power delivery, operators can expect a bulldozer that performs consistently on any job.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Operator Comfort in Every Season</h2>\r\n<p>Long days in the field require comfort, and the Cat D3 does not disappoint. The enclosed cab is fully <strong>air conditioned for the hot summer months</strong> and equipped with a powerful heating system for winter work. Beyond temperature control, the dozer also includes a <strong>heated seat</strong> and <strong>heated hand controls</strong>, keeping operators comfortable and reducing fatigue no matter the weather. This level of comfort means higher productivity and greater focus on the task at hand.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Why Rent the 2024 / 2025 Cat D3 Bulldozer?</h2>\r\n<p>Renting a bulldozer like the 2024 & 2025 Cat D3 allows contractors and landowners to get the benefits of the latest technology without the long-term cost of ownership. At Rent ’n King, we make sure our bulldozers are fully serviced, reliable, and ready to work the moment they arrive at your job site. With flexible rental terms and delivery options, you get the machine you need, when you need it.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Book Your Cat D3 Bulldozer Rental Today</h2>\r\n<p>When productivity, power, and comfort matter most, the <strong>2024 & 2025 Cat D3 Bulldozer</strong> is the smart choice. Contact Rent ’n King today to schedule your rental and experience the difference this machine brings to your project.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Proudly Serving Tennessee and Beyond</h2>\r\n<p>Our <strong>Cat D3 Bulldozer rental services</strong> cover areas in Tennessee including Dickson, Fairview, Centerville, Franklin, Bon Aqua, Charlotte, Van Leer, McEwen, Waverly, Burns, Clarksville, Santa Fe, Nashville, Primm Springs, Kingston Springs, Cumberland Furnace, Cunningham, and more. We are committed to delivering top-notch service, and we offer delivery to out-of-area locations, ensuring you get the equipment you need no matter where your project takes you.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Contact Us Today for Your Cat D3 Bulldozer Rental Needs:</strong> (615) 815-6734</p>', 'Cat D3 Bulldozer Rental – Comfort, Power &amp; Performance', 'Rent the 2024 Cat D3 Bulldozer for unmatched grading power, stability, and all-season comfort. Heated seat, hand controls, and A/C cab included.', 19, 20, 'Published', 'No', 3, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 05:03:54', '2025-11-22 09:18:32'),
(4, 'PCAT-YDGN-RAP6', NULL, 'Skid Steer', 'skid-steer-rental', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Skid Steer Rentals for Every Project</h1>\r\n<p>Looking for a powerful, versatile machine to handle your next job? Our skid steer rentals give you the right tool for the task, whether you’re grading a driveway, clearing land, moving dirt, or plowing snow. From cost-effective options to fully equipped forestry packages, we provide a complete range of skid steers and attachments to fit your needs.</p>\r\n<h2>New: JCB Teleskid Now Available</h2>\r\n<p>Add reach and versatility that standard loaders can’t match. Our <strong>JCB Teleskid</strong> features a telescopic boom that:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Reaches higher and farther</strong> — load trucks from one side, stack higher, and place materials over obstacles.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Works below grade</strong> — dig, clean out basins, or pull material from behind walls or fences.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Saves time repositioning</strong> — complete more tasks from a single setup with fewer machine moves.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Improves operator safety & comfort</strong> — side-door entry and excellent visibility speed up work on congested sites.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Acts like four machines in one</strong> — combines the jobs of a CTL, telehandler, small wheel loader, and forklift.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em>Ideal for:</em> loading from one side, reaching into dump trailers or over barriers, backfilling from a distance, handling pallets/materials on tight jobsites, and specialty maintenance tasks.</p>\r\n<h2>Open Cab Skid Steer Rentals</h2>\r\n<p>If you’re looking for a budget-friendly choice, our open cab skid steers deliver high performance at a lower cost. They’re perfect for quick projects and operators who don’t mind working outdoors.</p>\r\n<h2>Closed Cab Skid Steer Rentals with Heat & AC</h2>\r\n<p>Stay comfortable and focused while working in dusty, hot, or cold environments. Our closed cab skid steers feature heating and air conditioning, keeping operators out of the dust and weather while boosting productivity.</p>\r\n<h2>Large 111 HP Skid Steers for Heavy-Duty Projects</h2>\r\n<p>For jobs that demand serious muscle, our 111 HP closed cab skid steers are built to move high volumes of dirt, rock, or debris quickly and efficiently. These machines are ideal for commercial projects and large-scale site work.</p>\r\n<h2>Full Forestry Packages</h2>\r\n<p>Our forestry skid steer packages turn your machine into a land-clearing powerhouse. Equipped with forestry mulching heads, brush grapples, and other specialized attachments, these units are perfect for clearing trees, thick brush, and overgrowth.</p>\r\n<h2>Brush Cutter & Skid Steer Combinations</h2>\r\n<p>Take on overgrown lots, roadside maintenance, or pasture reclamation with a skid steer and brush cutter combo. These machines cut through tall grass, saplings, and brush with ease, saving time and reducing labor.</p>\r\n<h2>Skid Steer Snow Plow Rentals</h2>\r\n<p>Winter storms are no problem with our skid steer snow plow setups. Equipped with durable plows and enclosed heated cabs, these machines make snow removal fast, efficient, and comfortable.</p>\r\n<h2>Full Line of Skid Steer Attachments</h2>\r\n<p>To make your rental even more versatile, we offer a complete selection of skid steer attachments:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Brush Cutters</strong> – Clear fields, fence lines, and overgrown lots.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Harley Rakes</strong> – Prepare soil, grade, and level with precision.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Augers</strong> – Drill holes for fencing, posts, and landscaping.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Brush Grapples</strong> – Move logs, debris, and brush with ease.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Smooth & Toothed Buckets</strong> – Tackle general dirt work, digging, and hauling.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Forestry Mulching Heads</strong> – Grind trees and vegetation into mulch for complete land clearing.</li>\r\n<li><strong>(Perfect with the Teleskid)</strong> — Use the extra reach to <strong>load from one side</strong>, <strong>place materials over fences</strong>, and <strong>stack higher</strong> with these attachments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Rent Your Skid Steer Today</h2>\r\n<p>No matter the season or the project, we have the skid steer rental solution to get the job done. From open cab cost savings to closed cab comfort, heavy-duty horsepower, the <strong>JCB Teleskid</strong>, and specialized attachments, our fleet is ready to go to work for you. Contact us today to schedule your rental and get the machine you need to complete your project on time.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Call us today at (615) 815-6734</strong> to reserve your skid steer rental and get your project moving!</p>', 'Skid Steer Rentals | Open and Closed Cab, Forestry Systems', 'Rent skid steers with open cab, closed cab, forestry packages, brush cutter combos, and snow plow setups. Full line of attachments available for every project.', 13, 82, 'Published', 'No', 0, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 05:16:04', '2025-11-16 20:51:11'),
(5, 'PCAT-ZYCU-FGJA', NULL, 'Telehandlers', 'telehandler-rental', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Telehandler Rentals for Every Job Site</h1>\r\n<p>When your project requires lifting heavy materials high and far, nothing gets the job done like a <strong>telehandler rental</strong>. Sometimes called a <strong>reach forklift</strong> or a <strong>Lull</strong>, telehandlers combine the power of a forklift with the reach of a crane. At Rent ’n King, we provide reliable, high-capacity telehandlers to meet the needs of contractors, builders, and construction crews across Middle Tennessee.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Why Rent a Telehandler?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Unmatched Reach:</strong> Telehandlers extend materials upward and outward, making them essential for steel building construction, roofing, and multi-story projects.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Heavy-Duty Power:</strong> With high lift capacities, they can move palletized materials, lumber, and steel beams with ease.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Versatility:</strong> Attachments such as forks, buckets, and lifting hooks turn your telehandler into a multi-purpose job site machine.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Job Site Efficiency:</strong> Reduce downtime and labor costs by placing materials exactly where they’re needed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Telehandler vs. Forklift</h2>\r\n<p>While a standard forklift is limited to ground-level lifting, a <strong>telehandler (reach forklift)</strong> gives you the ability to safely lift and extend materials into elevated or hard-to-reach locations. This makes telehandlers the preferred choice for outdoor construction, steel erection, and large-scale building projects.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Industries That Benefit From Telehandler Rentals</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Steel Building Construction:</strong> Lift and place trusses, beams, and sheet metal panels with precision.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Roofing Contractors:</strong> Move bundles of shingles or roofing materials onto higher levels with ease.</li>\r\n<li><strong>General Contractors:</strong> Keep your job site moving efficiently by reducing manual lifting and staging.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Agriculture & Landscaping:</strong> Telehandlers are excellent for moving hay bales, logs, or other heavy loads across rough terrain.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>New: JCB Teleskid Now Available</h2>\r\n<p>Add reach and versatility that standard loaders can’t match. Our <strong>JCB Teleskid</strong> features a telescopic boom that:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Reaches higher and farther</strong> — load trucks from one side, stack higher, and place materials over obstacles.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Works below grade</strong> — dig, clean out basins, or pull material from behind walls or fences.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Saves time repositioning</strong> — complete more tasks from a single setup with fewer machine moves.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Improves operator safety & comfort</strong> — side-door entry and excellent visibility speed up work on congested sites.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Acts like four machines in one</strong> — combines the jobs of a CTL, telehandler, small wheel loader, and forklift.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em>Ideal for:</em> loading from one side, reaching into dump trailers or over barriers, backfilling from a distance, handling pallets/materials on tight jobsites, and specialty maintenance tasks.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Why Choose Rent ’n King?</h2>\r\n<p>At Rent ’n King, we provide more than just equipment — we deliver <strong>productivity, reliability, and peace of mind</strong>. Our telehandlers are inspected before every rental to ensure safety and performance. We also offer <strong>delivery service</strong> across Dickson, Clarksville, Nashville, and surrounding areas, so your machine is on-site and ready when you are.</p>\r\n<p><br><strong>Customer Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✔ Optimum sizes and capacities available</li>\r\n<li>✔ Flexible rental terms — daily, weekly, or monthly</li>\r\n<li>✔ Professional delivery and pickup</li>\r\n<li>✔ First-class customer support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Book Your Telehandler Rental Today</h2>\r\n<p><br>Don’t let heavy lifting slow down your project. Whether you call it a telehandler, reach forklift, or Lull, Rent ’n King has the right machine for your needs. <strong>Call us today at (615) 815-6734</strong> to reserve your telehandler rental and keep your job moving forward.</p>', 'Telehandler Rental | Reach Forklift &amp; Lull Rentals', 'Rent a telehandler (also known as a reach forklift or Lull) from Rent ’n King. Perfect for steel building construction, roofing, and heavy lifting.', 15, 16, 'Published', 'No', 5, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 05:51:43', '2025-11-16 20:53:59'),
(6, 'PCAT-XPEY-COYH', NULL, 'Scissor Lifts', 'scissor-lifts', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Scissor Lift Rentals for Safe & Efficient Access</h1>\r\n<p>When your job requires reliable vertical access, our scissor lift rentals deliver the safety and performance you need. With multiple platform heights and compact designs, our fleet is ready for indoor and outdoor projects of all sizes.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">19’ Scissor Lift Rentals</h2>\r\n<p>Our **19-foot scissor lifts** are compact, maneuverable, and ideal for indoor applications. They fit easily through standard doorways **without folding the guardrails down**, making them a practical choice for warehouses, maintenance tasks, and tight spaces.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">20’ Scissor Lift Rentals with Outriggers</h2>\r\n<p>The **20-foot scissor lift with outriggers** provides extra stability for material handling and elevated work. Like the 19’, this unit also passes through a standard doorway with ease, offering the same compact convenience while supporting jobs that need additional balance and load control.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">26’ Scissor Lift Rentals</h2>\r\n<p>For projects that demand more reach, our **26-foot scissor lifts** provide the extra height you need while maintaining safety and efficiency. Perfect for ceiling work, facility upgrades, and construction sites, these machines give you reliable elevation and wide platform space for tools and crew.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Why Choose Our Scissor Lifts?</h2>\r\n<p>✔ Compact designs fit through standard doorways without hassle <br>✔ Safe, stable platforms for working at elevated heights <br>✔ Options with outriggers for material support and stability <br>✔ Reliable lifts maintained for maximum performance and safety</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Reserve Your Scissor Lift Today</h2>\r\n<p>Whether you need a **19’, 20’, or 26’ scissor lift rental**, we’ve got the right machine for your project. From indoor facility maintenance to large-scale construction, our lifts make the job faster and safer.</p>\r\n<p>📞 Call us today at (615) 815-6734 to reserve your scissor lift rental and keep your project on schedule.</p>', 'Scissor Lift Rentals | 19’, 20’, and 26’ Scissor Lifts', 'Rent scissor lifts in 19’, 20’ with outriggers, and 26’ models. Compact designs fit through standard doorways. Call (615) 815-6734 to schedule today.', 21, 22, 'Published', 'No', 15, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 08:35:24', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(7, 'PCAT-NHSJ-IETH', NULL, 'Excavators', 'excavator-rental', NULL, '<h1 data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"278\">Mini Excavator Rentals – Full Range From 1.5 Ton to 10 Ton</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"725\"><strong data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"315\">Versatile Equipment for Any Job</strong><br data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"318\">When your project requires digging, trenching, or material handling, a mini excavator rental is the perfect solution. At <strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"455\">Rent ‘n King</strong>, we offer a full fleet ranging from compact 1.5-ton machines for tight access spaces to powerful 10-ton excavators designed for larger construction and landscaping jobs. No matter the scale of your project, we have the right excavator to get the job done efficiently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"1141\"><strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"773\">Every Mini Excavator Equipped With a Thumb</strong><br data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"776\">Unlike many rental companies, all of our excavators come standard with a thumb attachment. This makes them significantly more versatile, allowing you to lift, grab, and move logs, debris, rocks, and other irregular materials with ease. Whether you’re clearing land, loading brush, or setting utility lines, the added thumb makes a huge difference in productivity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1178\"><strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1176\">Compact to Heavy-Duty Options</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1311\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1311\"><strong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1210\">1.5–3 Ton Mini Excavators</strong>: Ideal for residential work, backyard projects, and tight spaces where larger equipment won’t fit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1457\"><strong data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1346\">4–6 Ton Mid-Sized Excavators</strong>: Perfect for utility work, small commercial sites, and landscape projects that require more power and reach.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1586\"><strong data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1483\">8–10 Ton Excavators</strong>: Built for heavy-duty excavation, large site prep, and jobs where power and efficiency are critical.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1902\"><strong data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1618\">Why Rent a Mini Excavator?</strong><br data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1621\">Renting a mini excavator allows you to complete projects faster and with less manual labor, all without the cost and responsibility of ownership. Our flexible rental terms, well-maintained equipment, and delivery options ensure you get the right machine exactly when you need it.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"2252\"><strong data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1948\">Reserve Your Mini Excavator Rental Today</strong><br data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1951\">From small residential projects to large-scale construction, <strong data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2028\">Rent ‘n King</strong> has the excavator you need. Call us today at <strong data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2092\">(615) 815-6734</strong> to discuss your project and reserve the right machine for the job. Our team is ready to help you get started and deliver the equipment straight to your site.</p>', 'Mini Excavator Rentals | Rent 1.5–10T Excavators with Thumbs', 'Rent mini excavators from 1.5 to 10 tons. All excavators include a thumb for added versatility. Perfect for digging, land clearing, and construction projects.', 23, 24, 'Published', 'No', 1, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 10:42:35', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(8, 'PCAT-6J14-V6QU', NULL, 'Mini Skids', 'mini-skid-rental', NULL, '<h1 data-start=\"224\" data-end=\"289\">Mini Skid Steer Rentals – Full Range of Power and Attachments</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"774\"><strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"325\">Mini Skid Steers for Every Job</strong><br data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"328\">When it comes to landscaping, construction, or property maintenance, a mini skid steer rental is one of the most versatile choices you can make. At <strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"492\">Rent ‘n King</strong>, we offer the full range of compact utility loaders, from standard 25 hp models perfect for everyday tasks to the powerful <strong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"634\">Vermeer CTX100</strong> and the super heavy-duty <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"678\">Vermeer CTX160</strong>. No matter the size of your project, we have the right machine to maximize your productivity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"968\"><strong data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"814\">Full Line of Attachments Available</strong><br data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"817\">Every job is different, which is why we provide a complete selection of attachments to transform your mini skid steer into a true all-in-one machine:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\n<li data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1047\">\r\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1047\"><strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"989\">Brush Cutters</strong> – Clear thick vegetation and overgrown areas with ease.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1141\"><strong data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1066\">Harley Rakes</strong> – Prep seedbeds, remove debris, and level soil for landscaping projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1228\"><strong data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1177\">Brush Grapples & Log Grapples</strong> – Handle logs, brush, and debris with precision.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1304\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1304\"><strong data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1241\">Augers</strong> – Drill clean, accurate holes for posts, trees, and fencing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1385\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1385\"><strong data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1320\">Trenchers</strong> – Cut trenches quickly for irrigation, utilities, or drainage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1528\"><strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1444\">Standard Buckets, Smooth Buckets & Oversized Buckets</strong> – Move dirt, gravel, and materials efficiently with the right bucket for the job.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1972\"><strong data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1561\">Why Rent a Mini Skid Steer?</strong><br data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1564\">Mini skid steers are compact, maneuverable, and powerful, making them ideal for jobs where larger equipment can’t fit. Whether you’re working in a backyard, a tight job site, or tackling heavy-duty commercial work, renting gives you access to the latest models without the cost of ownership. Pairing your rental with the right attachment ensures you get maximum versatility and efficiency on every project.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2277\"><strong data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2019\">Reserve Your Mini Skid Steer Rental Today</strong><br data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2022\">From landscaping and tree service to construction and property maintenance, <strong data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2114\">Rent ‘n King</strong> has the mini skid steer and attachments you need. Call us today at <strong data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2200\">(615) 815-6734</strong> to reserve your rental and get the right equipment delivered to your site.</p>', 'Mini Skid Steer Rentals | Vermeer CTX100 &amp; CTX160', 'Rent mini skid steers from 25 hp models up to the Vermeer CTX100 and CTX160. Full lineup of attachments including brush cutters, Harley Rakes, grapples and more', 25, 26, 'Published', 'No', 2, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 11:01:38', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(9, 'PCAT-WTCY-SMFR', NULL, 'Land Clearing', 'land-clearing-rental', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Land Clearing Rentals Made Easy with Rent \'n King</h1>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Full Forestry Package with Takeuchi TL12</h2>\r\n<p>When you need maximum productivity for land clearing, nothing compares to our **Takeuchi TL12 outfitted with a full forestry mulcher package**. This machine is purpose-built for heavy-duty clearing jobs. Equipped with a **dedicated hydraulic cooler**, the TL12 runs at peak performance all day long — even in the hottest Tennessee summers. That means less downtime, more efficiency, and a faster turnaround for your land clearing projects.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Closed Cab Skid Steers with Extreme Duty Brush Cutters</h2>\r\n<p>For medium-scale clearing jobs, our **standard closed cab skid steers paired with extreme duty brush cutters** deliver outstanding performance. These machines excel in tackling thick grass, brush, and small trees with ease. To prioritize safety, every skid steer is outfitted with a **1/2-inch polycarbonate safety door**, protecting operators from flying debris while maintaining clear visibility. It’s the perfect balance of power, protection, and versatility.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Why Choose Rent \'n King for Land Clearing?</h2>\r\n<p>- Heavy-duty forestry package with Takeuchi TL12 and mulching head - Hydraulic cooling system for extended productivity in hot conditions - Closed cab skid steers with extreme duty brush cutter attachments - Safety-first design with 1/2\" polycarbonate doors - Professional service, reliable equipment, and delivery to your jobsite</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Serving Tennessee and Beyond</h2>\r\n<p>Our land clearing rental services cover Dickson, Fairview, Centerville, Franklin, Bon Aqua, Charlotte, Van Leer, McEwen, Waverly, Burns, Clarksville, Santa Fe, Nashville, Primm Springs, Kingston Springs, Cumberland Furnace, Cunningham, and surrounding areas. Out-of-area delivery is also available to keep your project moving forward.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Call Us Today</h2>\r\n<p>Ready to tackle your land clearing project? Rent \'n King has the equipment to get it done right. Whether you need a full forestry package or a brush cutter skid steer, we’ll deliver the right machine for the job.</p>\r\n<p>📞 Call us today at (615) 815-6734 to reserve your land clearing rental equipment!</p>', 'Land Clearing Rentals–Forestry Mulcher &amp; Skid Steer Package', 'Clear land fast and safe with our Takeuchi TL12 forestry mulcher package or closed cab skid steers with extreme duty brush cutters. Call (615) 815-6734', 34, 35, 'Published', 'No', 4, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 12:24:00', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(10, 'PCAT-HS8S-IAYZ', NULL, 'Dump Trailers', 'dump-trailer_rental', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Dump Trailer Rental Services Near You</h1>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Affordable Dump Trailer Rentals for Every Job</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Looking for a reliable dump trailer rental?</strong> Our rental fleet makes it easy to haul debris, construction waste, landscaping materials, or household junk. Whether you’re a homeowner tackling a cleanup project or a contractor managing heavy loads, our dump trailers are built to handle the job efficiently and safely.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Why Choose Our Dump Trailer Rentals?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Heavy-duty capacity:</strong> Our trailers include multiple sizes, from compact models perfect for residential projects to large 14,000-pound rated trailers for commercial jobs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Easy to operate:</strong> Hydraulic lift systems make unloading quick and hassle-free.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Cost-effective:</strong> Renting saves you money compared to hiring hauling services or purchasing your own trailer.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Flexible scheduling:</strong> Daily, weekend, and weekly rental options are available to fit your project timeline.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Dump Trailer Rentals in Hickman, Dickson & Humpfreys </h2>\r\n<p>We proudly serve customers throughout <strong>Dickson, Hickman, Humphfreys, Nashville, Franklin, Clarksville, and surrounding Tennessee areas</strong>. Our convenient location allows us to provide fast delivery and pickup so you can stay focused on your project. No matter where your job site is — residential neighborhoods, commercial construction sites, or rural properties — we’ve got you covered.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Perfect for Contractors and Homeowners</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Contractors:</strong> Streamline your worksite with a dependable dump trailer that can handle construction debris, shingles, or concrete tear-outs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Homeowners:</strong> Save time and trips to the landfill during home renovations, spring cleanups, or landscaping projects.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Landscapers:</strong> Move soil, mulch, brush, or stone with ease.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Book Your Dump Trailer Rental Today</h2>\r\n<p>Call us today at <strong>(615) 815-6734</strong> or book online to reserve your dump trailer. We make it easy to get the right size trailer delivered directly to your property or job site. Let us provide the equipment so you can get the work done faster, safer, and more efficiently.</p>', 'Dump Trailer Rental | Affordable Hauling Solutions | Hickman', 'Rent a dump trailer in Hickman and Humphreys county today! Affordable, heavy-duty trailer rentals for contractors, homeowners, and landscapers.', 48, 49, 'Published', 'No', 21, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 12:25:46', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(11, 'PCAT-ATLX-EBII', NULL, 'Equipment Trailers', 'equipment-trailer-rental', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Equipment Trailer Rental Services</h1>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Reliable Equipment Trailer Rentals for Every Hauling Need</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Need an equipment trailer rental you can count on?</strong> Our heavy-duty equipment trailers are designed to safely haul skid steers, mini excavators, tractors, and other machinery. Whether you’re a contractor moving job site equipment or a homeowner transporting a utility vehicle, our trailers provide the strength and reliability you need.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Why Rent an Equipment Trailer From Us?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Heavy-duty construction:</strong> Trailers built to handle heavy loads with reinforced frames and durable axles.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Multiple sizes available:</strong> From compact equipment trailers to large-capacity options for commercial machinery.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Easy loading and unloading:</strong> Equipped with ramps for skid steers, mini excavators, and tractors.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Flexible rentals:</strong> Daily, weekend, and weekly rental options to fit your schedule.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Delivered to your site:</strong> Save time with our fast delivery and pickup service.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Equipment Trailer Rentals in Hickman, Dickson & Humphreys County</h2>\r\n<p>We proudly serve customers throughout <strong>Hickman County, Dickson County, and Humphreys County</strong>. Our convenient rental process ensures you get the right trailer on time, whether for construction, farming, landscaping, or hauling utility vehicles.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Ideal Uses for Equipment Trailers</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Contractors:</strong> Move heavy equipment like skid steers, mini excavators, and trenchers with ease.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Homeowners:</strong> Haul tractors, UTVs, or other equipment for personal projects.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Landscapers:</strong> Transport compact track loaders, brush cutters, and landscaping machines.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Farmers:</strong> Move tractors, implements, and agricultural equipment safely.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Reserve Your Equipment Trailer Today</h2>\r\n<p>Call us today at <strong>(615) 815-6734</strong> or book online to reserve your equipment trailer rental. Our dependable trailers and flexible rental options make it easy to get your equipment where it needs to be — safely and efficiently.</p>', 'Equipment Trailer Rental | Haul Skid Steers, Tractors &amp; More', 'Affordable equipment trailer rentals in Hickman, Dickson, and Humphreys County. Perfect for hauling skid steers, tractors, and mini excavators. Call today!', 50, 51, 'Published', 'No', 20, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 12:26:15', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(13, 'PCAT-OI5D-IRWC', NULL, 'Mowers', 'zero_turn_mower_rentals', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Lawnmower Rental: <br>60″ Zero-Turn Mowers for Residential & Commercial Projects</h1>\r\n<p>Need a <strong>lawnmower rental</strong> that finishes acres fast and leaves a professional cut? We stock a focused lineup of <strong>zero-turn lawnmowers</strong>—all with <strong>60-inch decks</strong>—so you can match the job without guessing. Pick a residential model for homeowner comfort and easy handling, or step up to a commercial unit for all-day productivity and durability. Either way, you’ll get speed, clean stripes, and the agility to work around trees, beds, and obstacles.</p>\r\n<h2>Why Choose a 60″ Zero-Turn Lawnmower Rental</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Faster acres/hour:</strong> Wide 60″ deck covers ground quickly and reduces overlap.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pro-grade cut quality:</strong> Deep, reinforced decks maintain blade tip speed for a crisp finish in tall or wet grass.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Tight maneuvering:</strong> True zero-turn lets you trim close—less string-trimming afterward.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Easy transport:</strong> Trailer-friendly footprint for quick pickup and drop-off.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Two Lines, One Goal: The Right Lawnmower for Your Job</h2>\r\n<h3>Residential 60″ Zero-Turn (Homeowner-Focused)</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Comfort first:</strong> Supportive seat and intuitive controls for longer sessions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Clean, even cut:</strong> Reinforced deck with adjustable height for changing turf conditions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Great value:</strong> Pro-level results without the commercial price tag.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Commercial 60″ Zero-Turn (All-Day Productivity)</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Heavy-duty build:</strong> Commercial frame, serviceable spindles, and robust hydros.</li>\r\n<li><strong>High output:</strong> Power and deck airflow to keep pace in thick, overgrown turf.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Durability:</strong> Built to withstand frequent use on large properties.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Who Benefits from Our Lawnmower Rentals?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Homeowners & acreage:</strong> Knock out seasonal growth and reclaim weekends.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Property managers:</strong> Maintain multiple sites with a consistent, professional finish.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Contractors & landscapers:</strong> Bridge equipment gaps during peak season or big bids.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>FAQs: Lawnmower Rental</h2>\r\n<h3>What size deck do you rent?</h3>\r\n<p>All of our <strong>lawnmower rentals</strong> are <strong>60-inch zero-turn mowers</strong> for faster cutting and pro results.</p>\r\n<h3>Should I pick residential or commercial?</h3>\r\n<p>Choose <strong>residential</strong> for comfort and value on single-property work. Choose <strong>commercial</strong> for heavier use, thicker turf, or multiple properties in a day.</p>\r\n<h3>Can I tow the mower on a standard utility trailer?</h3>\r\n<p>Yes—most 60″ zero-turns fit common landscape trailers. Verify your trailer, hitch, and tie-downs meet weight and safety requirements.</p>\r\n<h3>Do you offer delivery and quick start help?</h3>\r\n<p>Yes—call today to ask about delivery options: (615) 815-6734.</p>\r\n<p>We’ll review controls, deck height, and safety basics so you can get to work immediately.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p><strong>Ready to book?</strong> Reserve your <strong>lawnmower rental</strong> now—choose <em>Residential 60″ Zero-Turn</em> or <em>Commercial 60″ Zero-Turn</em>, add your dates, and you’re set. Or call us and we\'ll get your reservation set up for you: (615) 815-6734</p>', 'Mowers', NULL, 44, 45, 'Published', 'No', 14, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 12:27:28', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(14, 'PCAT-VOGY-5S20', NULL, 'Pressure Washers', 'pressure_washer_rentals', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Pressure Washer Rentals: <br>Hot Water & Cold Water Power Washers for Every Job</h1>\r\n<p>When dirt, grime, and grease build up, nothing beats the power of a professional-grade <strong>pressure washer rental</strong>. At <strong>Rent ’n King</strong>, we offer a full lineup of Simpson commercial pressure washers that deliver the cleaning performance you need. Whether you want the unbeatable cleaning power of hot water, or the versatile convenience of cold water, we’ve got the right machine for your project.</p>\r\n<h2>Simpson 4000 PSI 4.0 GPM Hot Water Pressure Washer Trailer</h2>\r\n<p><strong>For the toughest jobs,</strong> our 4000 PSI hot water pressure washer is mounted on a trailer for mobility and all-day power. Hot water breaks down grease, oil, and heavy build-up that cold water can’t touch. This makes it the perfect choice for industrial sites, equipment yards, and large commercial cleaning projects.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ 4000 PSI / 4.0 GPM cleaning power</li>\r\n<li>✅ Gas-powered with hot water capability</li>\r\n<li>✅ Trailer-mounted for easy transport to the jobsite</li>\r\n<li>✅ Includes 4 spray tips for multiple applications</li>\r\n<li>✅ Best for industrial cleaning, grease, oil, and heavy grime removal</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Simpson 4200 PSI 4.0 GPM Cold Water Pressure Washer</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Our most popular all-around model,</strong> the Simpson 4200 PSI cold water washer with the Honda GX390 engine is built for contractors, landscapers, and property managers who need high pressure and volume. It’s reliable, easy to use, and powerful enough to handle a wide range of outdoor cleaning projects.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ 4200 PSI / 4.0 GPM for balanced power and volume</li>\r\n<li>✅ Honda GX390 engine for proven reliability</li>\r\n<li>✅ Cold water design for versatility and lighter weight</li>\r\n<li>✅ Perfect for siding, decks, driveways, and heavy-duty property cleaning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Simpson PowerShot 3600 PSI 2.5 GPM Cold Water Pressure Washer</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Professional cleaning power in a smaller package,</strong> the 3600 PSI PowerShot washer is ideal for homeowners and small contractors. It delivers more than enough pressure for most residential and light commercial jobs, while being easier to move and store than larger units.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ 3600 PSI / 2.5 GPM cold water cleaning</li>\r\n<li>✅ Compact, lightweight frame for portability</li>\r\n<li>✅ Gas-powered for flexible use anywhere</li>\r\n<li>✅ Excellent choice for driveways, patios, fences, and outdoor furniture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Hot Water vs. Cold Water Pressure Washers</h2>\r\n<p>Choosing the right washer depends on your job:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ <strong>Hot water</strong> is essential for cutting grease, oil, and industrial grime.</li>\r\n<li>✅ <strong>Cold water</strong> is more affordable, lighter, and perfect for dirt, mold, mildew, and general property cleaning.</li>\r\n<li>✅ At Rent ’n King, we stock both options, so you can rent the exact machine your project requires.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Why Rent a Pressure Washer from Rent ’n King?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ Affordable daily, weekend, and weekly rates</li>\r\n<li>✅ Free reschedules for zero risk</li>\r\n<li>✅ Delivery available across our Tennessee service area</li>\r\n<li>✅ Commercial-grade machines maintained to the highest standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Service Area</h2>\r\n<p>We provide <strong>pressure washer rentals</strong> throughout Tennessee, serving <strong>Dickson, Fairview, Centerville, Franklin, Bon Aqua, Charlotte, Van Leer, McEwen, Waverly, Burns, Clarksville, Santa Fe, Nashville, Primm Springs, Kingston Springs, Cumberland Furnace, Cunningham</strong>, and beyond. If you’re outside this area, ask us about extended delivery options.</p>\r\n<h2>Reserve Your Pressure Washer</h2>\r\n<p>Ready to blast away dirt and grime? Reserve your pressure washer online today or call <strong>(615) 815-6734</strong> and one of our helpful staff members will enter the reservation over the phone for you. From the hot water trailer unit to powerful cold water Simpson models, Rent ’n King has the right washer for your next project.</p>', 'Pressure Washer Rentals | Hot &amp; Cold Water Power Washers', 'Rent professional pressure washers in Tennessee from Rent ’n King. Choose a hot water and cold water Simpson model with 4000 PSI trailer unit w/ 2,000 gal. tank', 54, 55, 'Published', 'No', 17, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 12:28:02', '2025-11-16 18:04:48');
