(17, 'PCAT-5GHC-6GNR', NULL, 'Trenchers', 'trencher_rental', NULL, '<!-- ===== Stump Grinder Rentals: Trenchers Page (Rent \'n King) ===== -->\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Trencher Rentals: <br>Compact to Heavy-Duty Options for Every Job</h1>\r\n<p>When you need clean, straight trenches for utilities, irrigation, drainage, or lighting, the right trencher can cut project time dramatically. At <strong>Rent ’n King</strong>, we stock a full lineup—from compact, budget-friendly walk-behind units to powerful ride-on trenchers and a mini skid loader with a 36\" trencher attachment. Below is a simple guide to help you choose the best machine for your job.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Ground Hog T-4 — Smallest & Most Economical</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> homeowners, irrigation lines, low-voltage wire runs, and tight spaces.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Compact, operator-propelled design fits through gates and narrow paths.</li>\r\n<li>Typical trench depths: 12\"–18\"; narrow trench width to minimize backfill.</li>\r\n<li>Simple controls—great for first-time users.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Barreto 13STKH Track Trencher — Mid-Size Walk-Behind</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> utility lines, water lines, irrigation, and medium-length runs where traction matters.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tracked undercarriage for grip on uneven terrain and softer ground.</li>\r\n<li>Boom dimensions: 24\" depth x 4\" chain width.</li>\r\n<li>Smooth hydraulic controls for steady forward pace and clean trench walls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Barreto RTK23 — Ride-On Power in a Compact Frame</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> contractors who need more horsepower and production than a walk-behind, but still want excellent maneuverability.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>23 HP Kohler EFI engine provides serious digging power in a mid-size package.</li>\r\n<li>Fully hydraulic steering and ground drive for precision trenching.</li>\r\n<li>Boom dimensions: 36\" depth with a 6\" trench width.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for residential and light commercial utility installations where space is limited.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Ride-On Tracked Trencher — Largest Production Option</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> long runs, commercial projects, and tougher soils where productivity rules.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Operator ride-on comfort for faster coverage and reduced fatigue.</li>\r\n<li>Wider track footprint for stability and straight, consistent trenches.</li>\r\n<li>Boom dimensions: ~36\" depth x 6\" chain width.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal when you need higher horsepower and deeper trench capability.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Vermeer CTX100 + 36\" Trencher — Extra-Power Option</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> deeper utility lines, tougher soil conditions, and high-throughput jobs.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mini-skid platform with serious hydraulic power for a 36\" trencher attachment.</li>\r\n<li>Excellent for contractors who need depth, torque, and all-day reliability.</li>\r\n<li>Tracks provide stability and low ground disturbance around finished lawns.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">How to Choose the Right Trencher</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Quick guide:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Depth/Width:</strong> Deeper or wider = RTK23, Ride-On, or CTX100; shallow = Ground Hog or 13STKH.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Run Length:</strong> Long runs favor RTK23, Ride-On, or CTX100 for speed and comfort.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Access:</strong> Tight gates & yards = Ground Hog T-4 or 13STKH.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Soil:</strong> Rocky/compacted = 13STKH, RTK23, Ride-On, or CTX100.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Budget:</strong> Ground Hog is most economical; CTX100 is premium.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Why Rent from Rent ’n King?</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Fast Delivery & Best Prices</strong> — plus a well-maintained fleet and friendly support. We offer daily, weekend, and weekly rates, and we’ll deliver right to your job site.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Service Area</h2>\r\n<p>We provide trencher rentals throughout Tennessee, including <strong>Dickson, Fairview, Centerville, Franklin, Bon Aqua, Charlotte, Van Leer, McEwen, Waverly, Burns, Clarksville, Santa Fe, Nashville, Primm Springs, Kingston Springs, Cumberland Furnace, and Cunningham</strong>. Need delivery outside this area? <strong>We can help.</strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Reserve Your Trencher</h2>\r\n<p>Ready to book? Call <strong>(615) 815-6734</strong> or <a href=\"../../../rentals/trenchers\">reserve your trencher online</a>. From the compact <strong>Ground Hog T-4</strong> to the <strong>Barreto RTK23</strong> and the powerhouse <strong>Vermeer CTX100</strong> with a 36\" attachment, Rent ’n King has the right machine for your job.</p>', 'Trencher Rentals | Ground Hog, Barreto &amp; Vermeer', 'Rent trenchers in Tennessee from Rent ’n King. Choose the compact Ground Hog T-4, mid-size Barreto 13STKH, ride-on 23RTK, or the powerful Vermeer CTX100', 42, 43, 'Published', 'No', 11, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 14:07:25', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(18, 'PCAT-UDZ3-WVJ9', NULL, 'Wood Chippers', 'wood-chippers', NULL, '<section aria-labelledby=\"chip-lineup\">\r\n<h2 id=\"chip-lineup\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Choose the Right Wood Chipper Rental for Your Job</h2>\r\n<p>From routine property cleanups to full removals and land clearing, we stock three levels of professional wood chippers so you can match capacity and power to the work.</p>\r\n<article aria-labelledby=\"chip-12\">\r\n<h3 id=\"chip-12\">12″ Wood Chipper — Residential & Light Commercial</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>True 12″ capacity</strong> for limbs, brush, and small logs.</li>\r\n<li>Pro-grade feed system for <strong>consistent chip size</strong> and faster cleanup.</li>\r\n<li>Great balance of <strong>performance and maneuverability</strong> for driveways and tight sites.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Perfect for homeowners and small crews who want professional results without the bulk of larger machines.</p>\r\n</article>\r\n<article aria-labelledby=\"chip-18-135\">\r\n<h3 id=\"chip-18-135\">18″ Vermeer Wood Chipper — 135 HP Diesel (High-Production)</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>18″ infeed</strong> reduces prep cuts and speeds takedowns.</li>\r\n<li><strong>135 horsepower diesel</strong> delivers the torque for all-day production.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for <strong>storm cleanup, large removals, and commercial</strong> tree work.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Step up to significant throughput and keep material moving on big jobs with fewer bottlenecks.</p>\r\n</article>\r\n<article aria-labelledby=\"chip-18-176\">\r\n<h3 id=\"chip-18-176\">18″ Wood Chipper — 176 HP Diesel (Extreme Duty)</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Maximum-duty 18″ capacity</strong> for bulky limbs and trunk sections.</li>\r\n<li><strong>176 horsepower diesel</strong> for the toughest, most continuous feeds.</li>\r\n<li>Built for <strong>land clearing, right-of-way, and full crew production</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>When downtime isn’t an option, this extreme-duty unit delivers top-end power and pace for professional tree service teams.</p>\r\n</article>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p><strong>How to book:</strong> Call us at (615) 815-6734 and we’ll match the chipper to your crew, material, and site access. Or pick your chipper size on this page, select your dates, and reserve online. </p>\r\n</section>', '18” Vermeer 1800 &amp; 12” BC1000XL Wood Chipper Rentals', 'Rent Vermeer wood chippers in Tennessee. The 18” Vermeer 1800 is perfect for large tree service projects, while the 12” BC1000XL is ideal for homeowners', 31, 32, 'Published', 'No', 9, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 14:51:57', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(19, 'PCAT-BZR5-PP2Q', NULL, 'Landscaping', 'landscaping_equipment_rentals', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Landscaping Equipment Rentals for Every Project</h1>\r\n<p>When it comes to landscaping projects, having the right tools makes all the difference. At Rent ’n King, we carry a wide range of landscaping equipment rentals to help homeowners, contractors, and property managers complete jobs quickly and efficiently. Whether you’re aerating, seeding, splitting logs, or tackling heavy-duty land clearing, we’ve got you covered.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Stinger 3000 – Aerator and Seeder Combo</h2>\r\n<p>The Stinger 3000 Aerator/Seeder combines two critical steps into one efficient pass. This machine not only aerates compacted soil but also plants grass seed at the same time, ensuring healthier, thicker lawns. Perfect for seasonal lawn renovation or new turf installation, it saves both time and effort.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Classen 18\" Self-Propelled Aerator</h2>\r\n<p>For smaller yards or residential projects, the Classen 18-inch self-propelled aerator is lightweight, maneuverable, and powerful. It’s designed to relieve soil compaction and promote deeper root growth, resulting in greener, healthier grass. Its self-propelled feature makes it easy to handle, even on uneven ground.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Turfmaker Straw Blower</h2>\r\n<p>If you’re finishing a seeding project, the Turfmaker Straw Blower ensures proper seed protection and moisture retention. It spreads straw evenly and quickly, helping to prevent soil erosion and improve seed germination rates. Ideal for both residential lawns and large-scale commercial sites.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Groundhog Portable Augers</h2>\r\n<p>Digging post holes or planting trees? The Groundhog portable auger makes the job simple and efficient. Designed for portability and ease of use, these augers can handle a variety of soil types and are perfect for fencing, sign posts, or landscaping projects that require precise digging.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Titan T-Post Drivers</h2>\r\n<p>When it comes to installing fencing, nothing beats the Titan T-Post Driver. Built for speed and ease, it drives posts into tough ground with minimal effort. This tool is a must-have for farms, ranches, and property owners looking to install fencing quickly and securely.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Barreto 1620 Full-Size Tiller/Cultivator</h2>\r\n<p>Break up tough ground and prepare soil with the Barreto 1620 full-size tiller/cultivator. This heavy-duty tiller is designed to handle larger jobs, making it perfect for creating garden beds, landscaping new areas, or preparing large sections of land for planting.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Barreto 922LS Log Splitter</h2>\r\n<p>Save time and back strain with the Barreto 922LS log splitter. Built for performance and durability, this splitter makes quick work of firewood preparation, handling even the toughest logs with ease. It’s a must for property owners looking to stockpile firewood efficiently.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Vermeer BC1000 & BC1800 Wood Chippers</h2>\r\n<p>For tree service and cleanup, we offer two powerhouse wood chipper models: Vermeer BC1000 – Compact and efficient, ideal for routine yard cleanup and smaller tree removal projects. Vermeer BC1800 – A high-capacity chipper for heavy-duty jobs, capable of handling larger diameter branches and professional-scale clearing. Both machines turn branches and debris into manageable mulch, helping you keep properties clean and safe.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Why Choose Rent ’n King for Landscaping Equipment Rentals?</h2>\r\n<p>✔ Wide selection of professional-grade landscaping tools</p>\r\n<p>✔ Well-maintained equipment ready for any job</p>\r\n<p>✔ Flexible rental options for homeowners and contractors</p>\r\n<p>✔ Expert support to help you select the right machine</p>\r\n<p><br>At Rent ’n King, we’re committed to helping you complete your landscaping projects with the best equipment available.</p>\r\n<p><br><strong>Contact us today to reserve your landscaping equipment rental and get the tools you need to work smarter, not harder - (615) 815-6734</strong></p>', 'Landscaping Equipment Rentals | Aerators, Tillers, Chippers', 'Rent professional landscaping equipment including aerators, seeders, straw blowers, augers, tillers, log splitters, and Vermeer wood chippers.', 46, 47, 'Published', 'No', 12, 4, 4, '2025-09-25 15:18:36', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(20, 'PCAT-E0PZ-DYCB', NULL, 'Roller Compactors', 'roller-compactor-rental', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Roller Compactors for Rent</h1>\r\n<p><strong>The Right Roller for Every Compaction Project</strong></p>\r\n<p>At Rent ’n King, we know that achieving proper compaction is critical for strong, lasting results. Whether you’re preparing a foundation, finishing a driveway, or compacting asphalt, our roller compactors deliver the performance you need. With multiple roller sizes and configurations available, we provide the right tool for your job — all maintained to the highest standards for reliability and safety.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">36-Inch Single Drum Roller Rental</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Compact and Maneuverable</strong></p>\r\n<p>Our 36-inch single drum roller is perfect for smaller job sites and tight working conditions. With its narrow frame and powerful vibration, this roller is ideal for residential construction, landscaping, trench backfills, and other jobs where maneuverability is just as important as compaction force.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">56-Inch Single Drum Roller Rental</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Mid-Sized Power for Larger Projects</strong></p>\r\n<p>For projects that require more coverage and compaction strength, our 56-inch single drum roller delivers dependable performance. This size roller is well-suited for roadwork, gravel driveways, and construction sites where a balance of power and productivity is essential.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Dual Drum Smooth Roller Rental</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Maximum Coverage and Smooth Finishes</strong></p>\r\n<p>Our dual drum smooth roller provides even compaction across both drums, making it a great choice for asphalt paving, parking lots, and other projects where a smooth, consistent finish is required. With ride-on comfort and efficient coverage, it’s the go-to roller for contractors who need to complete larger projects quickly.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Why Rent Roller Compactors from Rent ’n King?</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Cost-Effective, Reliable, and Flexible</strong></p>\r\n<p>Owning compaction equipment can be costly, but renting from Rent ’n King gives you access to the right roller when you need it — without the hassle of maintenance or storage. Our equipment is serviced and ready to perform, ensuring your job gets done efficiently. With daily, weekly, and monthly rental options, we make it easy to match the equipment to your project timeline.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Roller Compactor Rentals in Tennessee</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Proudly Serving Your Local Area</strong></p>\r\n<p>Rent ’n King provides roller compactor rentals across Middle Tennessee, including: - Dickson - Franklin - Clarksville - Nashville - Fairview - Centerville - Bon Aqua - Charlotte - Van Leer - McEwen - Waverly - Burns - Santa Fe - Primm Springs - Kingston Springs - Cumberland Furnace - Cunningham If you’re outside these areas, give us a call — we also deliver out-of-area to keep your projects moving.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Reserve Your Roller Compactor Today</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Serving Contractors and Property Owners</strong></p>\r\n<p>Whether you’re a contractor preparing a site or a property owner tackling a driveway project, Rent ’n King has the roller compactor you need. Our team will help you choose between a 36-inch roller, a 56-inch roller, or a dual drum roller to match your job requirements. <br>📞 <strong>Call Rent ’n King today at (615) 815-6734 to reserve your roller compactor rental!</strong></p>', 'Roller Compactors for Rent | Sheep\'s Foot and Smooth Rollers', 'Rent powerful roller compactors with sheep\'s foot or smooth. Ideal for soil, gravel, and asphalt compaction projects. Call today for roller compactor rental.', 27, 28, 'Published', 'No', 6, 4, 4, '2025-09-26 07:19:30', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(21, 'PCAT-NJQ4-TZDT', NULL, 'Tractor', 'tractor_rental', NULL, '<!-- ===== New Holland Workmaster 25 with Backhoe (Rent \'n King) ===== -->\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Rent the New Holland Workmaster 25 with Backhoe: <br>Versatile Tractor-Backhoe Rental</h1>\r\n<p>When you need a compact yet powerful tractor-backhoe combo for landscaping, small construction, or utility jobs, the <strong>New Holland Workmaster 25</strong> with a backhoe attachment is a top choice. At <strong>Rent ’n King</strong>, this versatile machine gives you digging, trenching, and lifting capabilities in one unit—delivered fast and priced right.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Why Choose the Workmaster 25 with Backhoe?</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Compact Power</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ Small enough to maneuver through tight job sites, yet strong enough for serious work.</li>\r\n<li>✅ Solid horsepower and torque for landscaping, grading, trenching, and site prep.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Multi-Function Utility</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ Backhoe handles trenching, stump removal, drainage work, and fence post excavation.</li>\r\n<li>✅ Equipped with a <strong>15\" bucket</strong>—a great all-around size for a variety of digging applications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Maneuverability & Control</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ Short wheelbase and tight turning radius for residential and small commercial projects.</li>\r\n<li>✅ Operator-friendly controls reduce fatigue during long workdays.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Transport</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ Compact enough for straightforward transport on a trailer or equipment hauler.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Key Features</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ ~25 horsepower engine for reliable performance</li>\r\n<li>✅ Rear PTO for added versatility with attachments</li>\r\n<li>✅ Backhoe digging depth approximately 8–12 feet (job dependent)</li>\r\n<li>✅ <strong>15\" bucket</strong> for flexible trenching and excavation</li>\r\n<li>✅ Dual-acting boom and dipper hydraulics for smooth operation</li>\r\n<li>✅ Rear stabilizer legs for balance and safety while digging</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Common Projects & Use Cases</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ Digging trenches for utilities, irrigation, or drainage</li>\r\n<li>✅ Excavating small foundations and footings</li>\r\n<li>✅ Removing stumps and roots</li>\r\n<li>✅ Preparing ground for landscaping or tree planting</li>\r\n<li>✅ Setting posts or fence lines</li>\r\n<li>✅ Backfilling and site cleanup after excavation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Why Rent Instead of Buy?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ <strong>Cost Savings</strong> – Avoid the large upfront investment of purchasing equipment.</li>\r\n<li>✅ <strong>No Maintenance Hassles</strong> – We handle service and upkeep.</li>\r\n<li>✅ <strong>Flexibility</strong> – Rent only when needed or switch machines as job requirements change.</li>\r\n<li>✅ <strong>Convenience</strong> – Delivery and pickup right to your job site.</li>\r\n<li>✅ <strong>No Storage Needs</strong> – No long-term storage or equipment housing required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Safety & Operation Tips</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ Always set stabilizers before digging.</li>\r\n<li>✅ Do not exceed reach or lift limits.</li>\r\n<li>✅ Use bucket teeth to break up compacted ground.</li>\r\n<li>✅ Operate smoothly for safe, efficient digging.</li>\r\n<li>✅ Inspect hydraulics, fluids, and pins before each use.</li>\r\n<li>✅ Wear protective gear: gloves, ear protection, and safety glasses.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Service Area & Rental Terms</h2>\r\n<p>We offer the <strong>New Holland Workmaster 25 with backhoe</strong> for rent throughout Tennessee, including <strong>Dickson, Centerville, Franklin, Bon Aqua, Charlotte, Van Leer, McEwen, Waverly, Burns, Clarksville, Santa Fe, Nashville, Primm Springs, Kingston Springs, Cumberland Furnace, and Cunningham</strong>. Choose daily, weekend, or weekly rentals. We provide fast delivery, flexible scheduling, and reliable service.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Reserve Your Tractor-Backhoe</h2>\r\n<p>Ready to book? Call <strong>(615) 815-6734</strong> to reserve the Workmaster 25 with backhoe today. Get professional performance at the best price—delivered to your site.</p>\r\n<!-- ===== SEO Meta (paste these into your CMS meta fields) =====\r\nMeta Title: New Holland Workmaster 25 Backhoe Rental | Rent ’n King\r\nMeta Description: Rent the New Holland Workmaster 25 tractor with backhoe attachment in Tennessee from Rent ’n King. Compact, powerful, and versatile for trenching, excavating, and landscaping. Fast delivery & best prices.\r\n-->', 'New Holland Workmaster 25 Tractor w/Backhoe Rental', 'Rent the Workmaster 25 tractor with backhoe attachment in Tennessee from Rent ’n King. Compact, powerful, versatile for trenching, excavating, and landscaping.', 52, 53, 'Published', 'No', 24, 4, 4, '2025-09-26 09:53:45', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(22, 'PCAT-BCY6-U59R', NULL, 'Stump Grinders', 'stump-grinder-rental', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">🌳 Stump Grinder Rentals: <br>Power, Versatility, and the Right Tool for Every Job</h1>\r\n<p><strong>Introduction</strong></p>\r\n<p>When it comes to removing tree stumps, having the right equipment makes all the difference. At Rent ’n King, we offer a full range of stump grinder rentals designed to match any project size — from small residential jobs to large-scale commercial removals. Whether you need an economical solution, an all-around performer, or the ultimate powerhouse, we have the stump grinder that gets the job done efficiently.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>  Barreto 13SGH – Economical Power for Small Jobs</h2>\r\n<p><br><strong>Perfect for homeowners and small-scale projects</strong>, the Barreto 13SGH stump grinder is compact yet effective. It’s easy to maneuver through gates and tight spaces, making it the go-to choice for residential stump grinding. Despite its smaller size, this grinder packs enough cutting power to remove stumps cleanly and quickly, saving you hours of hard labor with an axe or chainsaw.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key benefits:</strong> Compact and lightweight design Gas-powered for convenience Ideal for small yards and landscaping businesses on a budget</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>  Barreto 30SG – Full-Sized, Automatic Performance</h2>\r\n<p><br><strong>When the job calls for efficiency and comfort,</strong> the Barreto 30SG delivers. Featuring automatic controls and a full-size design, this model is built for tackling medium to large stumps with ease. Operators benefit from smooth hydraulic steering and effortless control, reducing fatigue while increasing productivity.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key benefits:</strong> Hydraulic-driven automatic functionality Designed for medium to large stump removal Operator-friendly with precision controls</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>  Vermeer SC48TX – The King of Stump Grinders</h2>\r\n<p><br><strong>For serious contractors and demanding projects,</strong> the Vermeer SC48TX diesel stump grinder reigns supreme. This heavy-duty track-mounted grinder combines raw power with stability, making it perfect for tackling oversized stumps in tough terrain. With its diesel engine and high-output cutting system, the SC48TX is considered the industry leader for rental stump grinders.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key benefits:</strong> Diesel-powered for unmatched performance Track-driven for superior traction on any terrain Ideal for commercial jobs, land clearing, and high-volume work</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>  Why Rent a Stump Grinder from Rent ’n King?</h2>\r\n<p><br><strong>Rent ’n King provides flexibility and reliability</strong> for all your stump removal needs. Whether you’re a homeowner clearing your backyard or a contractor tackling multiple properties, renting is a cost-effective alternative to buying. We maintain our equipment to the highest standards, ensuring you get safe, reliable, and powerful tools for your project.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Service benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Affordable daily, weekend, and weekly rates</li>\r\n<li>Free reschedules for zero risk</li>\r\n<li>Convenient delivery and pickup services</li>\r\n<li>Friendly, knowledgeable support team ready to help</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>  Serving Tennessee & Beyond</h2>\r\n<p><br>Our **stump grinder rental services** cover Tennessee communities including Dickson, Fairview, Centerville, Franklin, Bon Aqua, Charlotte, Van Leer, McEwen, Waverly, Burns, Clarksville, Santa Fe, Nashville, Primm Springs, Kingston Springs, Cumberland Furnace, Cunningham, and beyond. No matter the size of your job, we’ll deliver the right grinder directly to your project site.</p>\r\n<p><br>📞 Ready to reclaim your yard or clear land with professional-grade equipment?</p>\r\n<p><br>Contact Rent ’n King today at (615) 815-6734 to reserve your stump grinder rental.</p>\r\n<p><br>From the Barreto 13SGH to the Vermeer SC48TX, we’ve got the right stump grinder for your project — at the best price.</p>', 'Stump Grinder Rentals | Barreto &amp; Vermeer Stump Grinders', 'Rent stump grinders in Tennessee with Rent ’n King. Choose from the economical Barreto 13SGH, the full-sized Barreto 30SG, or the powerful Vermeer SC48TX diesel', 40, 41, 'Published', 'No', 10, 4, 4, '2025-09-26 09:58:27', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(23, 'PCAT-16H6-T8RN', NULL, 'Attachments - Mini Skid', 'attachments', NULL, NULL, 'Attachments', NULL, 255, 256, 'Published', 'No', 23, 4, 4, '2025-09-26 10:27:07', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(24, 'PCAT-QDSL-HWPL', NULL, 'Attachments - Skid Steer', 'attachments-skid', NULL, '<h1>Why Skid-Steer Attachments Are the Real Engine of Productivity</h1>\r\n<p>When people think “skid-steer,” they picture the machine. But the truth is simple: without <strong>skid-steer attachments</strong>, the loader doesn’t do much. The attachment is what turns raw hydraulic power into real work—clearing, grading, drilling, trenching, and lifting. If you’re renting a skid-steer, choosing the right <strong>skid-steer attachments</strong> is the most important decision you’ll make.</p>\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>Why Attachments Matter More Than the Machine</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Task-specific performance:</strong> A brush cutter, grapple, auger, Harley rake, or pallet forks each unlocks a different job. Pick the attachment, and the skid-steer follows.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Lower total cost:</strong> Renting the right <strong>skid-steer attachments</strong> eliminates extra labor and prevents “making do” with the wrong tool.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Speed & quality:</strong> Attachments convert hydraulic flow into clean cuts, straight holes, smooth grades, and safely lifted loads—faster, cleaner, and safer than manual methods.</li>\r\n<li><strong>One machine, many jobs:</strong> Swap attachments in minutes and move from demolition to grading to material handling without changing equipment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>Most-Rented Skid-Steer Attachments (and What They Do)</h2>\r\n<h3>Brush Cutters</h3>\r\n<p>Clear tall grass, briars, and small saplings quickly for lots, trails, and fence lines. A must-have for site prep and overgrowth control.</p>\r\n<h3>Root & Log Grapples</h3>\r\n<p>Grab, carry, and stack brush, roots, and storm debris with high clamp force and precise placement—ideal for land clearing and cleanup.</p>\r\n<h3>Augers</h3>\r\n<p>High-torque planetary drives drill straight, consistent holes for fence posts, deck footings, trees, and signs. Use the right bit diameter and extensions for depth.</p>\r\n<h3>Harley Rakes (Soil Conditioners)</h3>\r\n<p>Power rakes pulverize clods, windrow rocks, and leave a smooth, level finish—perfect for seedbed prep, lawn renovation, and driveway refresh.</p>\r\n<h3>Pallet Forks</h3>\r\n<p>Fast, accurate material handling for pallets, lumber, and jobsite supplies—keep projects moving and reduce manual handling risks.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>How to Choose the Right Skid-Steer Attachments</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Define the job:</strong> Clearing (brush cutter/grapple), grading (Harley rake), drilling (auger), lifting (forks).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Match soil & debris:</strong> Rocky ground favors heavy-duty teeth or combo chains; dense brush benefits from closed-front cutter decks.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Check machine specs:</strong> Verify hydraulic flow (standard vs. high-flow), operating capacity, and quick-attach compatibility.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Plan site access:</strong> Gate widths, slopes, and working room can dictate attachment size and style.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em>Tip:</em> Tell us your machine model and task—we’ll recommend the best <strong>skid-steer attachments</strong> for speed and finish quality.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>Why Rent Skid-Steer Attachments From Us</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Wide selection:</strong> Brush cutters, grapples, augers, Harley rakes, pallet forks, and more.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pro-maintained:</strong> Sharp cutting edges, tight hydraulics, and ready-to-work reliability.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Flexible terms:</strong> Daily, weekend, and weekly rates—with delivery options.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Expert guidance:</strong> We help you match <strong>skid-steer attachments</strong> to your timeline, terrain, and task.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>FAQs: Skid-Steer Attachments</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Do I need high-flow?</strong> Many attachments run on standard flow; some cutters and rakes perform best with specific GPM—ask us.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Can I rent multiple attachments?</strong> Yes. Bundle attachments to handle clearing, grading, and material handling in one trip.</p>\r\n<p><strong>What if I’m unsure?</strong> Share your scope and surface conditions. We’ll recommend the right <strong>skid-steer attachments</strong> for speed and safety.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section>\r\n<h2>Reserve Skid-Steer Attachments Today</h2>\r\n<p>Get more done with the right tool for the job. Reserve <strong>skid-steer attachments</strong> online or call <strong>(615) 815-6734</strong>—we’ll help you choose and schedule delivery so you can start working immediately.</p>\r\n</section>', 'Skid-Steer Attachments for Rent | Brush Cutters, Grapples', 'Rent skid-steer attachments to boost productivity—brush cutters, grapples, augers, Harley rakes, pallet forks, and more. Pro-maintained gear, fast delivery.', 293, 294, 'Published', 'No', 22, 4, 4, '2025-09-26 10:35:52', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(25, 'PCAT-B7ZC-UYPM', NULL, 'Concrete Tools', 'concrete-tool-rentals', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Georgia Buggy Rentals with Swivel Bucket <br>Why Professionals Choose Canycom</h1>\r\n<p>When it comes to concrete projects, efficiency and precision make all the difference. That’s why professional contractors turn to Georgia buggies with swivel buckets—and specifically, the Canycom Georgia Buggy, which has earned its place as the industry’s most trusted option. Renting one for your next project ensures you get the job done faster, cleaner, and with less effort.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Superior Maneuverability with a Swivel Bucket</h2>\r\n<p>Unlike straight-dump concrete buggies, a swivel bucket allows you to pivot and dump concrete exactly where you need it—even in tight or awkward spaces. This feature minimizes back-and-forth repositioning, saving time on the jobsite and reducing crew fatigue. The swivel dump makes finishing and spreading much easier, especially when working around forms, walls, or confined spaces.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">The Canycom Advantage</h2>\r\n<p>Canycom is widely recognized as the #1 Georgia Buggy brand in the industry. Here’s why professional concrete contractors love the Canycom model:</p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px; line-height: 1.4;\">✅ Heavy-Duty Performance – Built for large volumes, Canycom machines handle tough jobs with ease. <br>✅ Easy to Operate – Simple controls and ergonomic design make it user-friendly, even for first-time operators.<br>✅ Exceptional Stability – The wide-track design ensures safe operation across uneven terrain.<br>✅ Durable and Reliable – Contractors know Canycom for its long-lasting build quality, reducing downtime.</div>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Why Renting Beats Buying</h2>\r\n<p>For most contractors, renting a Georgia Buggy is the smarter choice. Buying and maintaining one can be expensive, especially if it’s not needed daily. Renting allows you to get the latest, best-performing Canycom model without the long-term investment. You’ll also benefit from professional servicing and maintenance, ensuring the machine is ready to perform as soon as it arrives at your job site.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Boost Productivity on Your Next Project</h2>\r\n<p>Concrete waits for no one—delays cost time and money. By choosing a Georgia Buggy with a swivel bucket, you give your crew the efficiency they need to pour, spread, and finish with greater speed and precision. The Canycom buggy delivers the performance professionals demand, and renting it ensures your project stays on schedule.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Rent a Canycom Georgia Buggy Today</h2>\r\n<p>Don’t let your crew waste time shoveling or fighting with outdated equipment. Upgrade your workflow with a Canycom Georgia Buggy rental and see why it’s the tool of choice for serious concrete professionals.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>📞 Call us today at (615) 815-6734 to reserve your Georgia Buggy rental and keep your project moving smoothly.</p>', 'Concrete Tools', 'Rent a Canycom Georgia Buggy with a swivel bucket for faster, easier concrete pouring. Trusted by professional contractors, Canycom delivers power and stability', 29, 30, 'Published', 'No', 13, 4, 4, '2025-09-26 15:36:49', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(26, 'PCAT-HUAP-4GHM', NULL, 'Brush Cutting', 'brush-cutting', NULL, '<h1>Brush Cutter Rentals in Tennessee: Which Option Fits Your Job Best?</h1>\r\n<p>Clearing overgrown land, fields, encroaching brush, or heavy undergrowth demands the right equipment. We provide professional brush cutter rentals throughout <strong>Dickson, Nashville, Clarksville, Franklin, Fairview, Centerville, and surrounding Tennessee areas</strong>. Whether you’re a homeowner tackling backyard overgrowth or a contractor reclaiming large acreage, we have the right solution:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Walk-behind flail mower / brush cutter (Cyclone Track)</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>4WD ride-on brush cutter (Brush Rover)</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Mini-skid (Vermeer CTX100) with rotary brush cutter attachment</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Skid steer with brush cutter attachment (Kubota SVL75-3 / Takeuchi TL8)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">1. Walk-Behind Flail Mower / Brush Cutter (Cyclone Track)</h2>\r\n<p>The <a href=\"https://orecamerica.com/products/walk-behind-flail-brush-mower-cyclone-track/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Orec Cyclone Track</a> is a walk-behind flail mower that chews through tall grass, weeds, brambles, and small saplings. Its track drive provides traction on hilly ground and soft soil. The flail blades create a fine mulch and reduce flying debris, making it a great choice for residential properties.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> smaller lots, fence lines, property edges, and tight spaces in neighborhoods like <strong>Bon Aqua, Kingston Springs, Charlotte, and Santa Fe</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">2. 4WD Ride-On Brush Cutter (Brush Rover)</h2>\r\n<p>The <a href=\"https://orecamerica.com/products/riding-brush-cutter-4wd-brush-rover/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Orec Brush Rover 4WD</a> is a ride-on mower designed for dense brush and saplings up to about 1¾″ thick. With 4WD traction and slope-handling capability, it’s built for larger projects where speed and operator comfort matter.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> medium to large fields, pastures, and vacant lots across <strong>Franklin, Fairview, and Centerville</strong> where productivity is a priority.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">3. Mini-Skid with Brush Cutter Attachment (Vermeer CTX100 + Virnig V20)</h2>\r\n<p>Our <strong>Vermeer CTX100 mini-skid</strong> paired with a <a href=\"https://www.virnigmfg.com/product/v20-mini-skid-steer-open-front-rotary-brush-cutter/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Virnig V20 rotary brush cutter</a> clears brush and saplings up to 3″ thick. Its compact design makes it perfect for reaching embankments, ditches, and tight-access areas where larger equipment won’t fit.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> uneven terrain and property cleanup projects in <strong>McEwen, Waverly, and Van Leer</strong>, where maneuverability is essential.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">4. Skid Steer with Brush Cutter Attachment (Kubota SVL75-3 / Takeuchi TL8)</h2>\r\n<p>For maximum land-clearing power, we use <strong>Kubota SVL75-3</strong> and <strong>Takeuchi TL8</strong> skid steers equipped with heavy-duty brush cutter attachments. These machines feature <strong>½-inch thick polycarbonate safety doors</strong> to protect operators from flying debris, ensuring both power and safety. Wide cutting decks and high-flow hydraulics deliver fast clearing on the toughest jobs.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>High-flow hydraulics</strong> to power through dense brush and small trees.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Thick polycarbonate doors</strong> for enhanced operator protection.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Wide cutting decks</strong> to cover large areas quickly.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Versatility</strong> to swap to buckets, grapples, or other attachments for site prep.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> large-scale land clearing, right-of-way projects, forestry work, and commercial sites across <strong>Nashville, Clarksville, Dickson County, and beyond</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Choosing the Right Brush Cutter</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Use a <strong>walk-behind flail mower</strong> for small plots and tight residential areas.</li>\r\n<li>Choose a <strong>ride-on 4WD Brush Rover</strong> for pastures and medium fields.</li>\r\n<li>Go with a <strong>mini-skid + brush cutter</strong> for maneuverability in banks and uneven ground.</li>\r\n<li>Rent a <strong>skid steer brush cutter</strong> for major land clearing in <strong>middle Tennessee</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Why Rent Instead of Buy?</h2>\r\n<p>Renting gives you the <strong>right tool for the job</strong> without the costs of ownership, storage, and maintenance. Our equipment is fully serviced and ready to work anywhere in <strong>Dickson, Nashville, Clarksville, Franklin, Fairview, and surrounding towns</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Reserve Your Brush Cutter Rental Today</h2>\r\n<p>Don’t waste time fighting overgrowth with the wrong equipment. From <strong>walk-behind mowers</strong> to <strong>skid steers with protective brush cutter attachments</strong>, we have the right machine for your land clearing project.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Call us today at (615) 815-6734</strong> to reserve your brush cutter rental in Tennessee and keep your project moving forward.</p>', 'Brush Cutter Rentals in Tennessee | Walk-Behind, Ride-On', 'Rent brush cutters in Tennessee. From walk-behind flail mowers to skid steers with brush cutter attachments, we serve Dickson, Nashville, Clarksville, Franklin', 36, 37, 'Published', 'No', 8, 4, 4, '2025-09-27 07:42:07', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
(30, 'PCAT-CMZU-GIPO', NULL, 'Generators', 'generator-rental', NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Generator Rentals: <br>Power Solutions for Every Job</h1>\r\n<p>When the lights go out or your project needs reliable power, having the right generator on hand makes all the difference. At Rent ’n King, we carry high-quality, dependable generators that deliver power where and when you need it. Whether you’re running tools on a job site, keeping lights on during an outage, or powering an event, our rental fleet has you covered.</p>\r\n<h2>Tri-Fuel Portable Generator – 9400W Heavy-Duty Power</h2>\r\n<p>For jobs that demand serious output <strong>and</strong> fuel flexibility, our <strong>tri-fuel</strong> generator runs on <strong>gasoline, propane, or natural gas</strong>. It delivers up to <strong>9400W peak / 7500W running on gasoline</strong> and provides robust performance for construction sites, large appliances, or backup power for homes and businesses. With <strong>electric start</strong> and <strong>CO-safety monitoring</strong>, it’s as easy to use as it is powerful. <em>(Output varies by fuel type.)</em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Tri-fuel capability:</strong> gasoline, propane, or natural gas</li>\r\n<li><strong>Up to 9400W peak / 7500W running (gasoline)</strong>; output derates on LP/NG</li>\r\n<li><strong>Electric start</strong> for quick, hassle-free operation</li>\r\n<li><strong>120/240V outlets</strong> for maximum flexibility (transfer-switch ready)</li>\r\n<li><strong>CO safety sensor</strong> for added protection</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for <strong>job sites, backup power, and large events</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<section aria-labelledby=\"honda-2000\">\r\n<h2 id=\"honda-2000\">Honda 2000 Watt 120V Inverter Generator – Compact & Quiet</h2>\r\n<p>When you need portable, quiet, and efficient power, the <strong>Honda 2000W inverter generator</strong> is a top choice. Its lightweight design makes it easy to transport, and the CO-MINDER system adds peace of mind by monitoring for carbon monoxide. Perfect for smaller tools, camping, tailgates, or residential backup where <strong>clean inverter power</strong> protects sensitive electronics.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>2000W class:</strong> up to 2000W surge / ~1600W running (check nameplate)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Inverter technology</strong> for clean, stable electricity (safe for electronics)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Lightweight and ultra-quiet</strong> design</li>\r\n<li><strong>CO-MINDER</strong> safety sensor</li>\r\n<li>Great for <strong>outdoor recreation, small tools, and residential use</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n<section aria-labelledby=\"which\">\r\n<h2 id=\"which\">Which Generator is Right for You?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Need serious job site or home backup power <strong>with maximum fuel flexibility</strong>? Choose the <strong>tri-fuel 9400W</strong> generator.</li>\r\n<li>Need a compact, quiet generator for lighter use or recreation? The <strong>Honda 2000W inverter</strong> is your best fit.</li>\r\n<li>Not sure which one you need? Our team will help match the right generator to your project.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n<section aria-labelledby=\"why\">\r\n<h2 id=\"why\">Why Rent from Rent ’n King?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Affordable <strong>daily, weekend, and weekly</strong> rental rates</li>\r\n<li><strong>Free reschedules</strong> for zero risk</li>\r\n<li><strong>Delivery and pickup</strong> across our Tennessee service area</li>\r\n<li><strong>Well-maintained, reliable equipment</strong> ready for every job</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n<section aria-labelledby=\"service\">\r\n<h2 id=\"service\">Service Area</h2>\r\n<p>We provide generator rentals throughout Tennessee, serving <strong>Dickson, Fairview, Centerville, Franklin, Bon Aqua, Charlotte, Van Leer, McEwen, Waverly, Burns, Clarksville, Santa Fe, Nashville, Primm Springs, Kingston Springs, Cumberland Furnace, Cunningham</strong>, and beyond. Extended delivery available on request.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section aria-labelledby=\"reserve\">\r\n<h2 id=\"reserve\">Reserve Your Generator</h2>\r\n<p>Need power on demand? <strong>Reserve your generator online</strong> today or call <strong>(615) 815-6734</strong> and one of our helpful staff members will enter the reservation over the phone for you. From the <strong>heavy-duty tri-fuel generator</strong> to the <strong>compact Honda 2000W inverter</strong>, Rent ’n King has the right solution for your power needs.</p>\r\n</section>', 'Generator Rentals | Portable Generators– Rent ’n King', 'Rent generators in Tennessee from Rent ’n King. Choose a heavy-duty 9400W dual fuel generator or the quiet, Honda 2200W inverter. Fast delivery &amp; best prices.', 56, 57, 'Published', 'No', 18, 4, 4, '2025-09-30 05:53:50', '2025-11-16 18:04:48'),
